  "Title": "ELSA-2026-500679: ovirt-engine-keycloak security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[15.0.2-7]\n- Build the overlay with security backports and updated bundled and shaded libraries\n- Backport secure Liquibase XML parsing and complete token-exchange permission checks\n- Harden disabled identity provider lifecycle and SAML assertion/signature validation\n- Disable HTTP-header X.509 lookup; preserve default TLS lookup and oVirt integration\n- Include security regressions, consolidated OpenVEX assessment and artifact verification\n- Embed VEX and artifact manifest; verify the RPM payload before packaging\n- Register explicit HTTPS redirect origins and provide existing-client migration",
